WEBVTT

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:05.340
No matter how much time passes by, the heat of the summer always remains the same.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.310
That's why, when this season arrives, I remember.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.530
The innocent days of a young girl.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:14.580
Unchanged, it continues to live inside me...

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.460
Ah, paradise, paradise!

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.070
Hm? Aren't we wandering this transient world because we haven't ascended to paradise yet?

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:06.340
Alright! Now's the chance.

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.520
Nothing can be helped.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.290
It'll be a disaster if someone should look while I am sleeping.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:30.090
Ok! Hmm? It's tight... hmm?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.890
The electric toilet's on maximum!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:41.870
Yasaka?! Oh no! 
 This isn't good!

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:51.360
Doesn't switch to low. 
 This must be broken.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.450
Hey, Kamigamo. Where were you?

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.870
Huh? I-I was taking a walk...

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.440
Fishing pond...

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:08.970
- Oh! Finally a hit!  - Me too!

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.230
Gal and Do

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.800
- Feels so good.  
- Yes, indeed.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.640
- What's up, Kaya?  
- I hope Jun is alright.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.780
I see. She's sharing a room with Hajime-chan.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.340
That room assignment -- did you decide?

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.470
Jun-chan was distancing herself from Hajime-chan...

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:45.030
- ...so using this as an opportunity, I hope they will come closer.  
- What have you done...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:49.210
Cuz I didn't know Jun-chan was a girl.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.320
C'mon, Kaya. You're such a worrier.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.780
You don't have to worry that much.
 Things will only be the way it will be.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.090
How irresponsible.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:06.030
- Jun-chan, too -- she should just tell everyone that she's a girl.  
- Arashi!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.550
Because she can't keep it a secret forever.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:15.000
- That's true... but how she'll do it is up to her.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.830
Arashi... make sure you say nothing to Hajime.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:24.340
I know that! 
 I promised I'll keep it a secret.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.410
Are you really sure...

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:30.980
Shall we go check up on them later?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.900
Kamigamo, you want some tea?

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:44.380
- Thank you very much. 
- Why are you so tense? Stretch out your leg and relax.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:49.960
- Nothing. I'm comfortable this way. 
- Really? You're a weird guy.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:53.090
Umm... may I have some salt?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.840
Are you OK, Kamigamo? 
 Hurry up, and take it off!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.690
Take it off, or you'll get a burn! 
 Here, hurry!!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.270
Why are you so slow! Here, hurry up!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.000
You don't have to be so angry, OK?

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.870
It's your fault for being so insensitive!!

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:33.680
You're so short-tempered. 
 Alright...

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.190
...let's go take a bath.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.740
Kamigamo, if your burn is fine, let's go to the open-air bath.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.900
Hm? Where is Kamigamo?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.500
No... no way!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.230
- Looks good there. 
- Do you want to join me?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:04.010
- So cold!  
- W-Water bath?!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.080
Why are you in this?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.570
- Do you know what a sauna is? 
- Sauna? - Sauna?

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.530
You alternate between a steam bath and a water bath.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:17.470
You sweat a lot, so the slimming effect makes you thinner...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.720
...and your clogs wash off, so your skin is smoother.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:29.020
- We don't... sweat.
- We're ghosts.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.150
- Do you think we'll feel the effect? 
- But we're ghosts.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:36.530
Hey Jun! Where are you?

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:41.860
'Sup. What's going on?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.470
Jun's missing. I invited him for a bath, but he's disappeared.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:51.060
Huh? He probably doesn't want to take a bath with other people.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:55.020
Kids nowadays are sensitive.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:59.050
OR! He's conscious that IT hasn't grown down there yet.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.450
Don't worry! NOTHING has grown yet on me either.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.900
Either way, I don't like it! 
 I'll find him and drag him in.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:14.430
- Keep it in moderation. 
- Why?

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.370
Some don't like to be forced.

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:21.460
But I want to play with him. We're friends.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.460
There's more to being friends.

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:27.910
People have different feelings.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.120
Once you're in the city, you should care about that.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.220
Tsk, so troublesome!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:40.870
- Murata-san. 
 - Huh? 
 - Master-san was asking if you wanted to play Mahjong.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.460
Hmm, sounds good!

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.420
Have fun, boys.

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.950
Alright, we'll see how this goes.

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:05.560
- Oh, you girls can play Mahjong? 
- Yes, somewhat.

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.740
We had to stay in the mansion for a long time.

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:11.750
So, we've learned about such amusement fairly well.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.570
But competing against 2 rather than 4 people is different.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.690
I feel awkward playing against KIDS, huh?

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:24.560
Just shut up, and take your seat. 
 Scared that you'll get stripped by KIDS and GIRLS?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.020
Interesting... show me what you got!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:35.000
I understand Yasaka is trying to be friendly...
 But I can't help it...

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:40.250
If you were a boy, you could've been a better friend.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:45.480
I understand that... 
 But I'm really a girl, so...

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:49.190
You are too conscious that you're a girl...

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:53.310
...means it's not that bad with Hajime-chan, right?

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.370
No way! Impossible! Why Yasaka?

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:01.950
Anyhow, Arashi-san will be troubled if that happens.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.910
Or maybe she won't?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.450
Found you, Kamigamo!

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:13.440
- Yasaka!! 
- Stay still. I'll strip you this moment and...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:19.240
- Aaa! Wait!! 
- No way, no way, no way! Absolutely impossible!!!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.410
- Wait! Why do you run away?!  
- Because you're chasing me!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.060
I wouldn't chase you if you didn't run away!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.830
W-a-a-i-t!!!

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.270
I'm running away because you're chasing me!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.160
- Umm...may I have some salt? 
- Men's bath? Oh no!

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.600
Give up! I'm not letting you get away.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:06.120
- Girls don't like guys who don't take baths.  
- But...

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:11.060
C'mon. You've come this far. 
 Don't run away!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:21.650
Wow! Such a huge bath. Alright, let's go in.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:27.330
Hmm, Ladon springs huh? 
 Sounds like a monster.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:32.880
Wow, what's an electric bath? Sounds scientific. 
 Let's get in this one!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:40.270
What are you doing, Kamigamo? 
 I've brought you a towel, so use it...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.340
- W-Wait!   
- You're so insistent!

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:53.300
Don't be so shy. I don't have it yet...

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:57.640
- That's not the problem!! - Such a sore loser!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:08.210
- W-What is this?  
- Wanna sweat before the bath, Hajime-chan?

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:11.860
- Arashi-san? 
- Speaking of sleepovers, let's have a pillow fight!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.470
Take Jun-chan away.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.260
I don't believe he'll fall for such a crude method...

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:26.390
Arashi-san after a bath....so beautiful...

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:30.040
- There's no reason to deny this!  
- He's fallen for it?!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.850
- Alright, Arashi-san!  
- Anytime, c'mon!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.730
- Ok, Jun. Now's the chance. 
- O-Ok.

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.940
- Too weak!!  
- What!?

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.020
- Here you go! 
- I'm serious!

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.100
- What are you doing Jun?  
- Oh, OK.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.940
Thank you for saving me.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.240
Talk about your gratitude with Arashi.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:19.190
If it wasn't for her, Hajime wouldn't listen.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.240
Hajime really likes Arashi.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:27.370
But that's just a childish aspiration.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.760
Do you honestly feel that way?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.950
If that's true, there's nothing to worry about...

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:39.110
Kaya-san, is there something going on with Arashi-san?

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.610
Does she have someone else that she likes?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.180
I don't know. You should ask Arashi directly.

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.460
Pon!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.110
Chi!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.670
Pon!

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.970
Once more, Chi!

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:05.330
What? "Ryu-Ii-So", "Tenpai", "Hadaka-Tanki" on the fourth round?!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.980
"Yakuman" if he wins. Such strong draws.

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:11.030
Shall I tell you my alias?

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:15.180
People call me "Hideo the Howler!"

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:22.290
- You are finished... 
- Kan!

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:27.840
"Rin-Shan!" 
 "Tsumo!"

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.710
WHAT?!

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:35.140
- "Dai-San-Gen." 
- IMPOSSIBLE!!!!

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:38.000
- Kan-Dora, Kan-Dora! - You've got some Kan-Dora there.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:41.270
Yayoi's pile is the split, so that's a double point there.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:44.030
You mentioned it, so you're responsible, OK?

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:49.880
Damn, Master. 
 Don't make a kid go on errands.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.330
But I like shopping at an unfamiliar place.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:00.360
R-Really?

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:07.680
Kamigamo! How dare you run away... 
 I'll drag you into the bath.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.400
What are talking about? I've already taken the bath.

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:16.780
I waited for you, but you were playing pillow fight with Arashi-san.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.340
I got tired waiting for you in the bath.

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.170
If you want to, go in alone.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:33.010
- The wind feels so nice. 
- The stars are beautiful. 
- And the bugs are chirping.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.750
And the grave yard is spooky.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:41.840
- Oh, a grave yard. 
- Oh... it's haunting.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:46.470
- Huh, Kamigamo. Are you scared? 
- N...N-No way!

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:51.980
- Hmph. Suspicious.  
- Oh, yes! I have a brilliant idea.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:54.800
Pon.

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:57.770
One will expose oneself.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.100
Pon.

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.150
The second will reveal everything.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.310
Pon!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.910
The third will take you to hell.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.410
Damn it! 
 The house should just win, whatever that means.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:15.210
I will teach you how to play Mahjong!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.870
"Tsumo!" 
 "Chu-Ren-Po-To!"

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:26.940
- WH-WHAAAAT!!!!  - Waiting for the "9".  
- That's a double "Yakuman."

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:31.960
Y-Y-YOU! Winning by "Chu-Ren-Po-To" will use up all your luck, and you will die!

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:36.790
I don't care. I'm a ghost already.  
 Anyhow, you're the house, so double the points, OK?

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.920
Hey, who wants to take a walk?

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:47.660
- Hear, hear!  
- This is THE event of the summer!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:50.290
DARE!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:54.310
- The energy is too much for a dare. 
- A-Aren't we supposed to take a walk?

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:59.600
We are walking.
 We'll choose turns with Janken and walk around the grave yard.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:05.140
- Are you scared? 
- I-I'm really sorry, I'm really scared.

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:11.000
- Scary stories and ghosts... I don't like them. 
- But... Yayoi-san, you're already a ghost...

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.090
Aaaa, you're so cute, Yayoi-chan!

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:19.180
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:25.620
Really? I'm touched, Arashiyama-senpai!

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:31.500
- Ch-Cherry blossoms?
- Yayoi-san must trust Arashi-san.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:36.000
Despite her ways, younger classmates relied on her.

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:42.560
- Jan-ken-pon! 
- Yay! I'm first!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.770
- Alright, that's the spirit! 
- Yeah! Count on me!

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.840
Yasaka Hajime, marching!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.700
S-second in line, I-I-I'll go.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:58.680
- Alright, that's the spirit. Scream if something happens. 
- Yes.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:05.410
- OK, third. My turn.  
- Good luck, Kaya.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:10.400
OK, next is Jun-chan.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:14.500
Yes.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:18.570
Hm? What's up? Are you scared?

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:21.980
Don't worry. Call for me, and I'll come rescue you.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.300
I have something to ask you, Arashi-san.

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:30.820
Arashi-san, what do you think about him. 
 About Yasaka?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:37.440
- Do you like him?  
- Um, what? What are you saying all of a sudden, Jun-chan?

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:41.660
I want to know. He adores you so much...

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.110
...and you don't seem to mind.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:49.620
But it's a different story if you see Yasaka in a romantic way, right?

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:56.510
I mean, you won't try to make me closer to Yasaka after knowing that I'm a girl.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:00.010
Can you tell me?

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:06.230
Alright, indeed the relationship between me and Hajime-chan is a bit weird.

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:12.210
By connecting with Hajime-chan, I exist in this world through his life essence.

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.800
And Hajime-chan, without having second thoughts on danger...

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.960
...travels with me to the past.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.650
I rely on Hajime-chan unilaterally...

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:27.530
...and Hajime-chan, without hesitation, helps me.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:32.120
But I keep lying to myself about my own feelings...

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.600
"It looks like I rely on Hajime-chan...

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:40.100
...but I'm just using him through deception..."

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:44.710
- is what you're thinking, right? 
- N-No, not like that.   
- I won't deny it.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.860
Age-wise, I'm old enough, and I have responsibilities.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:54.760
- But in my case, it's special. 
- Special?

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:59.980
In regards to romance, I'm immature compared to my age.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:06.220
I was killed before having any kind of serious romance.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:12.220
Even after becoming a ghost, I haven't had any romance.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:15.900
I'm not even sure how it feels.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.440
- Arashi-san... 
- You understand, right?

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.320
Us ghosts...

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.640
...only exist during the summer.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:32.670
When summer ends, I will...

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.580
...disappear.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.350
As such, it's too painful to like someone.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.070
But I cannot complain. 
 We've perished once.

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:50.610
But, even during the summer...

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:54.870
....I am grateful that we can exist in this world once again.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.400
And live the moment to the fullest.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:03.400
Life is short. Girls, be in love
 before the blush on the lips fade.

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:09.970
It's too difficult for me. However, Jun-chan, as a living person, make sure to love a lot.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:18.100
- Jun-chan?   
- I'm sorry... I'm sorry.

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:26.500
Don't be sorry.  
 It's OK...it's OK.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.500
OK...

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:35.290
- Anyhow, it's your turn next.   
- Yes.

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:38.440
Kamigamo! What are you doing!?

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:40.420
Yasaka.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:45.790
You still haven't made your run...
 eh, are you crying because you're scared?

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.950
- How pitiful. 
- I-It's not that.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:54.620
Don't trouble Arashi-san too much. 
 Alright. Let's go! I'll come with you.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.750
I'm fine now.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:06.000
- C'mon, don't cry anymore.  
- I'm not crying.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.780
Ouch....what is it?

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.770
- It's you, Kaya-san.
- Don't scare me, Jun!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.340
You too, Kaya-san!

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:29.990
I was so scared, Senpai!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.310
You've done well, Yayoi-chan!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.310
OK! Stop being scared, and let's go, Kamigamo!

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.630
W-Wait, Yasaka!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.580
- Stop crying.  
- I'm not crying.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.670
OK? The only time a man can cry is...

00:21:43.920 --> 00:21:47.000
...at your parent's funeral and when you drop your wallet!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:56.200
Um... about the next month's rent... can I get an extension?

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.670
I don't mind, but you're working double time.
